From: wine-staging (vendored subset)
Subject: d3dx9_36, d3dx9_43: wine-staging's changes to the d3dx9 module

Modules: dlls/d3dx9_36 (built as d3dx9_43.dll), dlls/d3dx9_43/d3dx9_43.spec
Base: Wine 11.16

The Gcenx wine-staging 11.16 bundle ships a d3dx9_43.dll that includes wine-staging's d3dx9
patches: D3DXComputeTangent, D3DXCreateAnimationController from D3DXLoadMeshHierarchy, the
D3DXSPRITE_DONOTMODIFY_RENDERSTATE flag, and ID3DXEffect::SetRawValue for vector and structure
parameters. A plain Wine 11.16 build lacks them, so this patch brings the sources of this one
module level with the stock staging bundle. 0008 only matters because d3dx9_43.dll is rebuilt
with 0009 on top. The diff is wine-staging's (LGPL 2.1+, the same licence as Wine).

